      "writtenOn": "2022-01-21T20:22:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So if I make it \"#ifndef CONFIG_CHARGE_MANAGER\" I get several undefined errors like:\nec/common/usb_pd_dual_role.c:368: undefined reference to `pd_set_input_current_limit\u0027\n\nHonestly that suggests it\u0027s a bug in how we\u0027re compiling those undefined error files in that they should be linked with charge_manager.o\n\nI\u0027l explore that path while I await your thoughts on this and other comments.",
      "parentUuid": "dd59cbae_d59ae0fa",
      "revId": "df438ccb6420272fa1554fb840159016d43bf8d5",
